Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, wine-fex
Recommends: jwm
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Description: Plugin Licenses: start the license service of Windows plugins (Pivuan Audio)
 Windows plugins protected by iLok, and others with a license service, need
 that service running before they load, or they say they have no license.
 Windows starts it at boot; Wine only with its first program, and under FEX
 iLok's service needs about half a minute to answer. Plugin Licenses (Audio >
 Plugin Licenses in the Pivuan menu) starts the services Windows programs
 installed and says when they answer, so that the DAW can be opened then.
 They stop by themselves when the DAW closes, so their memory (about 1 GB for
 iLok's) is only used while plugins need it.
